that apply."] [:db/add "368851c4-156d-54b1-afce-4750f12eec6e" :question/worked-solution "An equilibrium is a constant function $y(t)=c$. Set $dy/dt=0$ and test the resulting equation.\n\nTest whether $f(c)=0$, where\n\n$$\nf(c) = - c^{2} - 3 c - 2\n$$\n\n- For $c=1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(1) &=-3 - 2 - 1 \\\\ &=-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=-1$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-1) &=-2 - 1 + 3 \\\\ &=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is zero, so it is an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=-2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-2) &=-4 - 2 + 6 \\\\ &=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is zero, so it is an equilibrium solution.\n\nSelect $y=-1$ and $y=-2$."] [:db/add "368851c4-156d-54b1-afce-4750f12eec6e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "368851c4-156d-54b1-afce-4750f12eec6e" :question/answer-fields "8c2c86b6-74b7-5ede-8f16-9a1dfb3cd63e"] [:db/add "368851c4-156d-54b1-afce-4750f12eec6e" :question/answer-fields "fe8aeb4a-79a3-5677-b20f-659d98f40591"] [:db/add "368851c4-156d-54b1-afce-4750f12eec6e" :question/answer-fields "d23dbb75-21f6-5af1-a687-1da787fc679f"] [:db/ensure "368851c4-156d-54b1-afce-4750f12eec6e" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186166788 :knowledge-point/questions "368851c4-156d-54b1-afce-4750f12eec6e"] [:db/add "a952e2c3-68f8-546e-ade9-3ef09f71678f" :answer/id #uuid "a952e2c3-68f8-546e-ade9-3ef09f71678f"] [:db/add "a952e2c3-68f8-546e-ade9-3ef09f71678f" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "a952e2c3-68f8-546e-ade9-3ef09f71678f" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "a952e2c3-68f8-546e-ade9-3ef09f71678f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "be0eaf59-64ce-5254-ab54-c7455a11131b" :answer/id #uuid "be0eaf59-64ce-5254-ab54-c7455a11131b"] [:db/add "be0eaf59-64ce-5254-ab54-c7455a11131b" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "be0eaf59-64ce-5254-ab54-c7455a11131b" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "be0eaf59-64ce-5254-ab54-c7455a11131b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "84d1f19c-c7fa-5669-a1ec-385f33d9039b" :answer-f