r $c=0$: Use $\\sin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(0) &=- \\pi + 0 - \\sin{\\left(0 \\right)} \\\\ &=- \\pi\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=- \\pi$: Use $\\sin{\\left(- \\pi \\right)}=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(- \\pi)= \\\\ - \\pi - \\sin{\\left(- \\pi \\right)} + \\pi \\\\ =0\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nThis is zero, so it is an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=\\pi$: Use $\\sin{\\left(\\pi \\right)}=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(\\pi)= \\\\ - \\pi - \\pi - \\sin{\\left(\\pi \\right)} \\\\ =- 2 \\pi\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\nSelect $y=- \\pi$."] [:db/add "a43b5bf3-6df3-53c4-be0b-ae5caac9b00d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "a43b5bf3-6df3-53c4-be0b-ae5caac9b00d" :question/answer-fields "84d1f19c-c7fa-5669-a1ec-385f33d9039b"] [:db/add "a43b5bf3-6df3-53c4-be0b-ae5caac9b00d" :question/answer-fields "4304d37a-d8b2-53e4-96af-2b9eb3c84d7f"] [:db/add "a43b5bf3-6df3-53c4-be0b-ae5caac9b00d" :question/answer-fields "d2d3589b-2631-5da8-8025-907e4f3c8f22"] [:db/ensure "a43b5bf3-6df3-53c4-be0b-ae5caac9b00d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186166788 :knowledge-point/questions "a43b5bf3-6df3-53c4-be0b-ae5caac9b00d"] [:db/add "eee386d6-b920-53bb-b286-3358dbf4c1d6" :answer/id #uuid "eee386d6-b920-53bb-b286-3358dbf4c1d6"] [:db/add "eee386d6-b920-53bb-b286-3358dbf4c1d6" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "eee386d6-b920-53bb-b286-3358dbf4c1d6" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "eee386d6-b920-53bb-b286-3358dbf4c1d6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b10d6571-e914-535b-910c-4208e33f02d7" :answer/id #uuid "b10d6571-e914-535b-910c-4208e33f02d7"] [:db/add "b10d6571-e914-535b-910c-4208e33f02d7" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "b10d6571-e914-535b-910c-4208e33f02d7" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "b10d6571-e914-535b-910c-4208e33f02d7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2b1dc939-0f88-5dc6-bd14-6fa82a81c7a4" :answer-field/id #uuid "2b1dc9