kbox] [:db/add "6ab1f704-3056-5646-8676-7149592aa979" :answer-field/choices "979cf84c-f786-523f-9f74-3010ec2c6e5b"] [:db/add "6ab1f704-3056-5646-8676-7149592aa979" :answer-field/choices "408ba05b-8ba3-574a-b60e-c4ab796a823d"] [:db/add "6ab1f704-3056-5646-8676-7149592aa979" :answer-field/correct "979cf84c-f786-523f-9f74-3010ec2c6e5b"] [:db/ensure "6ab1f704-3056-5646-8676-7149592aa979" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "4c6e3e44-5152-5185-b121-d74f84d2d880" :question/id #uuid "4c6e3e44-5152-5185-b121-d74f84d2d880"] [:db/add "4c6e3e44-5152-5185-b121-d74f84d2d880" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}\\frac{dy}{dt}= \\\\ \\left(- y - e - 1\\right) \\ln{\\left(- y - 1 \\right)}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following are equilibrium solutions? Select all that apply."] [:db/add "4c6e3e44-5152-5185-b121-d74f84d2d880" :question/worked-solution "An equilibrium is a constant function $y(t)=c$. Set $dy/dt=0$ and test the resulting equation.\n\nFirst keep the original domain: $- y - 1>0$.\n\nTest whether $f(c)=0$, where\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(c)= \\\\ \\left(- c - e - 1\\right) \\ln{\\left(- c - 1 \\right)}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\n- For $c=-3$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(-3)= \\\\ \\left(- e + 2\\right) \\ln{\\left(2 \\right)}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=-4$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(-4)= \\\\ \\left(- e + 3\\right) \\ln{\\left(3 \\right)}\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=-2$: Use $\\ln{\\left(1 \\right)}=0$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{gathered}f(-2)= \\\\ \\left(- e + 1\\right) \\ln{\\left(1 \\right)} \\\\ =0\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\nThis is zero, so it is an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=0$, $- c - 1=-1$ violates the original domain, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\nSelect $y=-2$."] [:db/add "4c6e3e44-5152-5185-b121-d74f84d2d880" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "4c6e3e44-5152-5185-b121-d74f84d2d880" :question/answer-fields "a5313d1a-4bc2-52ea-b863-a0a21558cfed"] [:db/add "4c6e3e44-5152-5185-b121-d74f84d2d880" :question/answer-fields "45774ddf-32b6-5d7c-86d7-77e6f32e6dd5"] [:db/add "4c6e3e44-5152-5185-b121-d74f84d2d880" :question/answer-fields "48d1903c-d7e4-5425-aaac-f5e28ec428c8"] [:db/add "4c6e3e44-5152-5185-b121-d74f84d2d880" :question/answer-fields "6ab1f704-3056-5646-8676-7149592aa979"] [:db/ensure "4c6e3e44-5152-5185-b121-d74f84d2d880" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186166788 :knowledge-point/questions "4c6e3e44-5152-5185-b121-d74f84d2d880"] [:db/add "d645b0f6-ed6c-5ff7-a1e2-78e15ff11bd3" :answer/id #uuid "d645b0f6-ed6c-5ff7-a1e2-78e15ff11bd3"] [:db/add "d645b0f6-ed6c-5ff7-a1e2-78e15ff11bd3" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "d645b0f6-ed6c-5ff7-a1e2-78e15ff11bd3" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "d645b0f6-ed6c-5ff7-a1e2-78e15ff11bd3" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2ed719d0-b352-516b-ac00-f2d717a530b8" :answer/id #uuid "2ed719d0-b352-516b-ac00-f2d717a530b8"] [:db/add "2ed719d0-b352-516b-ac00-f2d717a530b8" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "2ed719d0-b352-516b-ac00-f2d717a530b8" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "2ed719d0-b352-516b-ac00-f2d717a530b8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "87d79efe-91d0-534e-91c1-8043cd24e582" :answer-field/id #uuid "87d79efe-91d0-534e-91c1-8043cd24e582"] [:db/add "87d79efe-91d0-534e-91c1-8043cd24e582" :answer-field/key "$y=1$"] [:db/add "87d79efe-91d0-534e-91c1-8043cd24e582" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "87d79efe-91d0-534e-91c1-8043cd24e582" :answer-field/choices "d645b0f6-ed6c-5ff7-a1e2-78e15ff11bd3"] [:db/add "87d79efe-91d0-534e-91c1-8043cd24e582" :answer-field/choices "2ed719d0-b352-516b-ac00-f2d717a530b8"] [:db/add "87d79efe-91d0-534e-91c1-8043cd24e582" :answer-field/correct "d645b0f6-ed6c-5ff7-a1e2-78e15ff11bd3"] [:db/ensure "87d79efe-91d0-534e-91c1-8043cd24e582" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "da815514-b25c-51f1-9b6d-e2087fad9218" :answer/id #uuid "da815514-b25c-51f1-9b6d-e2087f