est whether $f(c)=0$, where\n\n$$\nf(c) = \\frac{c^{2} + c - 2}{c - 1}\n$$\n\n- For $c=-2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-2) &=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is zero, so it is an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=1$, $c - 1=0$ violates the original domain, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=-3$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-3) &=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\n- For $c=4$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(4) &=6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is nonzero, so it is not an equilibrium solution.\n\nSelect $y=-2$."] [:db/add "d3cee2a6-f129-5d27-af14-edfba3e17138" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "d3cee2a6-f129-5d27-af14-edfba3e17138" :question/answer-fields "7a1d2ab6-f1a5-586e-884a-21bf9f4bcc9e"] [:db/add "d3cee2a6-f129-5d27-af14-edfba3e17138" :question/answer-fields "f33cff65-7bc3-5202-8422-90e2a4909d84"] [:db/add "d3cee2a6-f129-5d27-af14-edfba3e17138" :question/answer-fields "2552fa73-7483-5558-a3b6-499c5a97898e"] [:db/add "d3cee2a6-f129-5d27-af14-edfba3e17138" :question/answer-fields "1f283174-91c2-58a8-99fc-44d4bb4a0102"] [:db/ensure "d3cee2a6-f129-5d27-af14-edfba3e17138" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186166788 :knowledge-point/questions "d3cee2a6-f129-5d27-af14-edfba3e17138"] [:db/add "8faaa610-73fe-5875-949f-8fcb51af8bff" :answer/id #uuid "8faaa610-73fe-5875-949f-8fcb51af8bff"] [:db/add "8faaa610-73fe-5875-949f-8fcb51af8bff" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "8faaa610-73fe-5875-949f-8fcb51af8bff" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "8faaa610-73fe-5875-949f-8fcb51af8bff" :answer/validate] [:db/add "92074ae6-8208-56d4-a88c-ac57fb8798a1" :answer/id #uuid "92074ae6-8208-56d4-a88c-ac57fb8798a1"] [:db/add "92074ae6-8208-56d4-a88c-ac57fb8798a1" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "92074ae6-8208-56d4-a88c-ac57fb8798a1" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "92074ae6-8208-56d4-a88c-ac57fb8798a1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "83a60b17-c8d9-5ae3-8b29-42dfd3061910" :answer-field/id #uuid "83a60b17-c8d9-